    "enUS": {
      "description": "These are the eggs that cannot be saved -- they will never hatch.",
      "dialogue": {
        "5c2a8de84d5d4046b9b4": "I am afraid I have bad news for you, $N. This egg is too far gone. I can take it from you so that it may be disposed of properly.$B$BPlease don't be discouraged; we cannot save them all. If you find yourself in Feralas again, please try again. Bring another egg for the Super Egg-O-Matic!",
        "b66d03ac695377242fad": "These are the eggs that cannot be saved -- they will never hatch."
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
